description	"Narkina 5 Guard

Cowardly, ineffective soldiers who rely on gadgets to keep their foes in line.

^2Weaponry:
- Cowardly Melee
-- 50% Less Damage Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- DH-17 Blaster Pistol
-- Based on DC Carbine (1)
-- 150% Slower RoF
-- Mag Reload
- Stun Baton (1)
-- Low Damage, Causes Cripple
- Electro-Shock Emplacement
-- Trip Mine (3)
-- Causes Pulse/Cripple/Knockback
-- 50% Less Damage
- Pulse Grenade (1)
-- Causes Cripple

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Assemble (1)
- Ammo (1)"
